{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52457","headline":"回波乐 一○○ · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 一○○","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知识相伴侣，蹔时不觉老。\n面皱黑发白，把杖入长道。\n眼中冷泪下，病多好时少。\n怨家乌枯眼，无睡（张录作「眠」字）天难晓。\n朝夕乞蹔时，百长（张改作「年」）谁肯保。\n使者门前唤，手脚婆罗草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}